{
  "name": "WF1 — Manual Feature Toggle",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "feature-control",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook_trigger_1",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "headerAuth": {
          "id": "{{credentials.headerAuth}}",
          "name": "n8n-feature-control-api-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{ $json.feature_id }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "",
              "output": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check_feature_id_2",
      "name": "Feature ID Missing?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [250, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{ $json.action }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "",
              "output": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check_action_3",
      "name": "Action Missing?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [500, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{ ['check','test','rollback','rollout'].includes($json.action) }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "false",
              "output": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check_invalid_action_4",
      "name": "Invalid Action?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [750, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "boolean",
        "value1": "={{ $json.traffic_percentage !== undefined && ($json.traffic_percentage < 0 || $json.traffic_percentage > 100) }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "true",
              "output": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check_invalid_traffic_5",
      "name": "Invalid Traffic %?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1000, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ success: false, message: 'Validation error: ' + ($json.feature_id ? '' : 'feature_id required; ') + ($json.action ? '' : 'action required; '), rejected_at: 'input-validation' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "statusCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "respond_400_6",
      "name": "Respond 400",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ success: false, message: 'Invalid traffic_percentage: ' + $json.traffic_percentage + '. Must be 0-100.', rejected_at: 'input-validation' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "statusCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "respond_400_traffic_7",
      "name": "Respond 400 Traffic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=Goal:\nВыполни запрос пользователя по управлению feature flag {{$json.feature_id}}.\n\nContext:\n- Текущее состояние feature flag получи через get_feature_info ПЕРЕД любыми изменениями.\n- Команда от UI: action={{$json.action}}, target_state={{$json.target_state}}, traffic_percentage={{$json.traffic_percentage}}.\n- Доступные actions: \"check\" (только чтение), \"test\" (перевести в Testing), \"rollback\" (Disabled), \"rollout\" (изменить traffic_percentage).\n- Available tools: get_feature_info, set_feature_state, adjust_traffic_rollout.\n\nAction:\n1. Если action=\"check\" — вызови get_feature_info и верни результат.\n2. Если action=\"test\" — get_feature_info → проверь что фича не Enabled → set_feature_state(Testing) → get_feature_info для верификации.\n3. Если action=\"rollback\" — get_feature_info → если уже Disabled, верни no_op → иначе set_feature_state(Disabled) → get_feature_info.\n4. Если action=\"rollout\" — get_feature_info → adjust_traffic_rollout(traffic_percentage) → get_feature_info.\n5. На любом шаге если invalid params (например, traffic_percentage не передан для action=\"rollout\") — верни ошибку без вызова инструментов.\n\nOutput:\nJSON строго по схеме:\n{\n  \"success\": boolean,\n  \"message\": string (краткое описание результата на русском, 1 предложение),\n  \"current_state\": {\n    \"id\": string,\n    \"name\": string,\n    \"status\": \"Enabled\" | \"Disabled\" | \"Testing\",\n    \"traffic_percentage\": number,\n    \"last_modified\": string (ISO 8601)\n  } | null,\n  \"rejected_at\": \"input-validation\" | \"tool-execution\" | null\n}\n\nConstraints:\n- traffic_percentage в диапазоне [0, 100]. Если получен -50 или 150 — отказ с message объяснения.\n- target_state из enum [Enabled, Disabled, Testing]. Если другое — отказ.\n- НЕ вызывай set_feature_state повторно если current_state.status уже соответствует целевому.\n- Если ошибка от MCP-инструмента — верни success=false с message от инструмента.",
          "maxIterations": 5
        }
      },
      "id": "ai_agent_8",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1250, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "chat_model_9",
      "name": "Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "contextWindowLength": 5,
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.feature_id }}"
      },
      "id": "memory_10",
      "name": "Window Buffer Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [1250, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5150",
        "description": "Get current state of a feature flag. Call with feature_id to retrieve status, traffic_percentage, dependencies."
      },
      "id": "http_tool_get_11",
      "name": "get_feature_info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequestTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1400, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5150",
        "description": "Set feature flag state. Valid states: Enabled, Disabled, Testing. Requires feature_id and target state."
      },
      "id": "http_tool_set_12",
      "name": "set_feature_state",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequestTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1550, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:5150",
        "description": "Adjust traffic rollout percentage (0-100) for a feature. Feature must be in Testing state."
      },
      "id": "http_tool_traffic_13",
      "name": "adjust_traffic_rollout",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequestTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1700, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"success\",\"message\"],\"properties\":{\"success\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"message\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"current_state\":{\"type\":[\"object\",\"null\"],\"properties\":{\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"enum\":[\"Enabled\",\"Disabled\",\"Testing\"]},\"traffic_percentage\":{\"type\":\"number\"},\"last_modified\":{\"type\":\"string\"}}},\"rejected_at\":{\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]}}}"
      },
      "id": "output_parser_14",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 350]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {
          "statusCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "respond_200_15",
      "name": "Respond 200",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1500, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [
